         SplashScreen API needs before Compose (and WardenTheme) ever runs,
         so it can't just reference the Compose value directly.
         Vault Ledger branding pass, 2026-09-15: #0052FF (Wisma electric-
         blue) -> #2F5D50 (vault green). Was #2E5E4E (an even older teal,
         pre-Wisma) before that. -->
    <color name="warden_primary">#2F5D50</color>
